.TH SWAYDESK-CAFFEINE-POPUP 1 2026-11-14 "swaydesk 0.1.10" "Sway desktop components"
.SH NAME
swaydesk\-caffeine\-popup \- caffeine popup for Waybar
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B swaydesk\-caffeine\-popup
.SH DESCRIPTION
Turns caffeine on and off: while it is on there is no lock, screen blanking or suspend on idle; closing the lid still locks. The state belongs to the sway\-caffeine helper; this popup only has the buttons.
.PP
Running it again while the popup is open closes it, and opening it closes the other popups of the bar. Esc, clicking outside or switching workspace also closes it.
.PP
The session runs it under the name waybar\-caffeine\-popup (a link in the package's helper directory to /usr/bin/swaydesk\-caffeine\-popup); the process name is waybar\-caffeine\-popup too.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-check
Exit 0 at once without doing anything: the Python launchers use it to check that the binary and its libraries load.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/swaydesk/config.toml
The desktop configuration: language, accent color, GTK and icon themes, folder color, file manager, weather location and holidays.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR swaydesk (7)
